BITS 1_Elements repeating thrice
Success rate: 55.77%

Given an array arr[] of N positive elements in which every element is repeating thrice but 1 element is repeating 2 times. Find the element repeating 2 times.

Input Format:
The first line contains size of array.
Second line contains the elements of the array.

Output Format:
Output the required number.

Constraints:
1 <= N <= 10^5
1 <= arr[i] <= 10^5

Sample test cases

Input
8
2 5 4 5 2 5 4 4

Expected output
2

